# Multiplayer rooms run over Supabase Realtime (presence + broadcast only,
# no database tables). These two are meant to be public in the browser:
# the anon key only opens Realtime rooms.
#
# Set both in Netlify too (Site configuration → Environment variables),
# applied to production (and deploy previews if you use them).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
